    "kn5_on_cart_feasibility": "KN-5 does not fit on-cart: the full-corpus fit holds 4621191 unique n-gram entries (orders 2-5; 3759337 unique 5-gram contexts alone) and the 256 MiB-cap fit still holds 2715582 5-gram contexts. Every entry needs a packed multi-char context key plus smoothed continuation statistics — several bytes per entry before any runtime code — while the 8 MiB MBC5 ROM ceiling is already saturated by the deployed d192 ROM (8,388,608 bytes, ~6.07 MiB of it weight code). No committed on-cart KN-5 representation or DMG-latency evaluation of one exists.",
